+ * IOHIDLibUserClient, IOHIDEventService, IOHIDResourceDeviceUserClient, IOHIDEventDriver), in the order the
+ * source uses them. Userland (hidd, IOHIDLib, backboardd) and dexts read/write these names, so they must match.
